\begin{abstract}
We present a unified scientific framework coupling compressible fluid dynamics,
Hamiltonian ray tracing, and chaotic optical-encryption. The system operates on
the eikonal mass-shell constraint $H_c = \mathbf{p}^2 - n(\mathbf{r})^2 = 0$,
